WEBVTT

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:24.850
December 31st 21:35 Kobe

00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:40.180
Hate Fiend  Audium

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:24.660
Asuka Tennoji

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:24.660
What's that?

00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:27.660
December 31st 21:36 Kobe Mountains

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:31.790
Chitose Aoba           Katana Samurai Rindo

00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:34.300
Ultimate Dinosaur  Orichalcum Tyranno

00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:37.300
Sera Kurashiki

00:02:36.020 --> 00:02:37.300
It's huge...

00:02:42.230 --> 00:02:43.380
Audium...

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:49.610
I feel a terrible hatred.

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:53.400
Far worse than before!

00:03:05.150 --> 00:03:07.750
Hawk 1, locked on giant Z/X!

00:03:07.990 --> 00:03:09.150
Attack!

00:03:09.150 --> 00:03:10.020
Roger!

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:16.920
We got it!

00:03:18.140 --> 00:03:18.670
Wait!

00:03:23.860 --> 00:03:25.180
It didn't work!

00:03:25.740 --> 00:03:28.680
Mikado Kurosaki

00:03:26.020 --> 00:03:27.070
Interesting!

00:03:27.570 --> 00:03:28.680
Alexander!

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:34.090
I've finally found prey worthy of me!

00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:33.600
Nine Worthies Alexander

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:56.950
It disappeared!

00:03:57.590 --> 00:03:59.210
What was that?

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:05.930
Black Blade Sieger              Ayase Kamiyugi

00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:08.330
Sword Sniper Rigel              Azumi Kagamihara

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:13.830
I never thought you'd have 
tamed a Z/X that powerful.

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:16.810
What are you talking about?

00:04:17.140 --> 00:04:19.670
I'll want to hear the details.

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:24.860
January 1st 07:08 Kobe

00:04:27.890 --> 00:04:31.350
January 1st 10:00 Kobe Sea Hotel

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:35.810
What about you?

00:04:35.810 --> 00:04:37.140
You just attacked us out of nowhere!

00:04:37.140 --> 00:04:38.480
What do you want?

00:04:39.530 --> 00:04:41.090
World conquest.

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:42.290
Seriously?

00:04:42.290 --> 00:04:46.090
Our immediate objective 
is the Nara Black Point.

00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:50.100
Kobe will be our supply base.

00:04:50.410 --> 00:04:54.230
If you do what we say, 
we won't hurt you.

00:04:54.740 --> 00:04:56.600
You expect us to believe that?

00:04:57.000 --> 00:04:58.980
I don't need you to believe that.

00:05:00.390 --> 00:05:03.810
You will be placed under my observation.

00:05:04.580 --> 00:05:06.490
Stay together as much as you can.

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:08.670
What? Why?

00:05:08.670 --> 00:05:11.240
I don't want to have to deal 
with any further trouble.

00:05:11.690 --> 00:05:16.210
Since a single Card Device 
can only store one Z/X,

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:19.750
I know none of you are Audium's partner.

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:24.300
But it's too risky for our army to 
advance with her still out there.

00:05:25.140 --> 00:05:27.510
We must do something immediately.

00:05:28.190 --> 00:05:30.260
Mikado, I borrowed them for you.

00:05:30.570 --> 00:05:33.140
What? What did you borrow?

00:05:33.590 --> 00:05:36.390
Device detectors!

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:37.730
Detectors?

00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:41.270
These detectors can locate 
devices with Z/X in them.

00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:45.280
We're going to use these 
to find Audium's partner.

00:05:45.540 --> 00:05:46.270
Really?

00:05:46.270 --> 00:05:47.500
We'll go, too.

00:05:48.090 --> 00:05:50.890
We can't just leave her out there, either.

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:53.540
That's true, but...

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:55.600
You want to look with us?

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:56.390
Yeah.

00:05:58.050 --> 00:05:59.070
Okay!

00:05:59.070 --> 00:05:59.970
They can, right?

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:02.920
Chitose, you go with them.

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:04.810
I have to go, too?

00:06:04.810 --> 00:06:07.320
It's partially to ensure the safety of this city.

00:06:07.780 --> 00:06:09.830
You believe in helping others, right?

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:12.200
All right!

00:06:15.170 --> 00:06:20.910
Why do I have to run around with people 
I was just fighting half a day ago?

00:06:15.830 --> 00:06:19.710
January 1st 11:32 Kobe City

00:06:20.910 --> 00:06:23.150
I wouldn't mind continuing our fight.

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:24.940
Now, now...

00:06:31.420 --> 00:06:35.730
Don't worry. They're just 
on the lookout for Audium.

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:39.210
The defense forces are on 
the side of the people.

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:40.980
We need to find them soon.

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:47.070
These detectors respond to the 
resources emitted by Card Devices.

00:06:47.070 --> 00:06:51.220
I think a Black World Z/X like Audium 
will require a ton of resources.

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:54.200
So if we follow the biggest purple dot,

00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:55.970
we should find her partner.

00:07:01.680 --> 00:07:05.160
I'm only seeing responses from 
Macedonian Soldier partners.

00:07:05.890 --> 00:07:08.530
It won't be that easy.

00:07:10.590 --> 00:07:14.300
January 1st 13:38 Kobe - Sannomiya Shopping District

00:07:17.270 --> 00:07:18.500
Did you find something?

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:20.440
That looks delicious!

00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:28.410
Crêpes?

00:07:28.410 --> 00:07:29.370
Buy me one!

00:07:29.370 --> 00:07:30.520
Huh?

00:07:30.520 --> 00:07:31.940
Buy me one!

00:07:33.570 --> 00:07:35.970
You did something mean to 
me yesterday, didn't you?

00:07:40.820 --> 00:07:43.230
Buy me one and I'll forgive you!

00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:45.980
Don't make me sound so evil!

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:47.330
Crêpes...

00:07:48.660 --> 00:07:50.930
Stare...

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:03.380
Tasty!

00:08:03.880 --> 00:08:04.720
Right?

00:08:06.520 --> 00:08:08.430
Give me some!

00:08:18.070 --> 00:08:21.020
Aina Mikage

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:22.670
Aina?

00:08:23.130 --> 00:08:23.970
Aina!

00:08:28.490 --> 00:08:29.400
Aina!

00:08:30.830 --> 00:08:32.320
Tennoji?

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:33.310
What's wrong?

00:08:33.310 --> 00:08:34.780
You look pale.

00:08:35.650 --> 00:08:36.910
Do I?

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:55.160
M-Mom!

00:08:58.050 --> 00:08:59.520
Want me to walk you to the dorms?

00:09:00.520 --> 00:09:01.820
That's okay.

00:09:01.820 --> 00:09:03.530
I can go by myself.

00:09:04.280 --> 00:09:05.290
Bye.

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:16.570
Sera?

00:09:25.680 --> 00:09:29.400
January 1st 14:11 Kobe Fountain Park

00:09:29.110 --> 00:09:30.340
Find her?

00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:31.880
She wasn't over there.

00:09:32.140 --> 00:09:33.790
Jeez...

00:09:33.790 --> 00:09:36.720
Well, Tyranno's with her, 
so we don't have to worry.

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:38.140
We do!

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:41.340
We can't leave a little girl 
like her alone in this city.

00:09:41.750 --> 00:09:44.140
I'm sure she's lonely and crying right now!

00:09:53.570 --> 00:09:55.090
<i>Let's see...</i>

00:09:55.090 --> 00:09:56.700
<i>Mom, this one, too!</i>

00:09:56.700 --> 00:09:57.900
<i>Right, right.</i>

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:01.110
<i>Make sure you don't cut your fingers.</i>

00:10:01.520 --> 00:10:03.380
<i>I can handle this much!</i>

00:10:04.490 --> 00:10:07.970
<i>You still can't sleep? 
What will I do with you?</i>

00:10:07.970 --> 00:10:09.080
<i>But...</i>

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:12.710
<i>You're nine years old! 
You're so spoiled.</i>

00:10:18.820 --> 00:10:19.840
Mom!

00:10:28.250 --> 00:10:29.730
Is something wrong?

00:10:30.030 --> 00:10:33.240
No, no. Nothing.

00:10:36.020 --> 00:10:38.580
I'm sorry. I thought you were someone else.

00:10:39.290 --> 00:10:40.090
I see.

00:10:44.550 --> 00:10:45.770
That's right.

00:10:45.770 --> 00:10:47.680
There's no way she could be...

00:10:49.520 --> 00:10:51.040
...here.

00:11:02.360 --> 00:11:06.080
January 1st 14:27 Kobe - Sannomiya Station

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:06.390
She wasn't by the west exit.

00:11:06.390 --> 00:11:08.560
I didn't see her in the square, either.

00:11:08.790 --> 00:11:10.790
Can't we use the detector to find her?

00:11:11.730 --> 00:11:13.240
How do you use it?

00:11:13.240 --> 00:11:14.760
I don't know!

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:18.810
You're useless when it counts, aren't you?

00:11:18.810 --> 00:11:20.870
Let's head back to the shopping district.

00:11:28.010 --> 00:11:28.940
Azumi!

00:11:28.940 --> 00:11:30.090
What's wrong?

00:11:30.090 --> 00:11:31.210
She's having an attack.

00:11:34.050 --> 00:11:35.060
Here, Azumi.

00:11:37.640 --> 00:11:39.800
I'm sorry for the trouble.

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:48.970
January 1st 15:39 Kobe - Chinatown

00:12:13.760 --> 00:12:16.870
<i>Early this morning, a mysterious 
robot appeared in Nagoya</i>

00:12:16.870 --> 00:12:18.940
<i>and the city was plunged into chaos.</i>

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:23.720
Robot Z/X in Nagoya City
Citizens ordered to evacuate

00:12:28.530 --> 00:12:31.170
<i>We'll announce information on the 
damage as it becomes available,</i>

00:12:31.170 --> 00:12:32.980
<i>but at the moment, we've lost contact</i>

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:34.980
<i>with our reporter, Kurashiki, 
who was covering the scene.</i>

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:34.980
Missing reporter Kurashiki

00:12:36.370 --> 00:12:38.270
<i>According to information 
we've just received...</i>

00:12:37.630 --> 00:12:38.800
<i>My mom...</i>

00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:42.760
January 1st 16:15 Kobe Suburbs

00:12:49.650 --> 00:12:52.760
<i>I think I'll be back in two weeks or so.</i>

00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:55.290
<i>I'll be fine!</i>

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:58.630
<i>Don't worry about me, Mom. 
Just go to Nagoya to get your story!</i>

00:12:58.970 --> 00:13:01.250
<i>I'll be watching the news!</i>

00:13:01.250 --> 00:13:02.160
<i>Okay!</i>

00:13:03.740 --> 00:13:05.120
<i>See you soon.</i>

00:13:06.610 --> 00:13:10.240
January 1st 16:45 Kobe - Enju Shrine

00:13:22.290 --> 00:13:23.630
<i>Mom!</i>

00:13:25.020 --> 00:13:26.780
<i>Mom!</i>

00:13:27.750 --> 00:13:29.280
<i>Mom!</i>

00:13:30.540 --> 00:13:32.160
<i>Mom!</i>

00:13:33.090 --> 00:13:34.360
<i>Mom!</i>

00:13:35.560 --> 00:13:36.950
<i>Mom!</i>

00:13:37.840 --> 00:13:39.920
<i>Mom!</i>

00:14:04.530 --> 00:14:07.420
Mom!

00:14:47.960 --> 00:14:49.740
You're trying to make me feel better?

00:14:58.020 --> 00:15:01.650
<i>Our reporter, Kurashiki, who was 
on the scene, remains missing.</i>

00:15:01.650 --> 00:15:03.070
<i>A search is underway.</i>

00:15:03.540 --> 00:15:04.580
<i>I know.</i>

00:15:04.580 --> 00:15:08.510
<i>I'll go to Nagoya, to look for my mother.</i>

00:15:44.970 --> 00:15:45.850
<i>No!</i>

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:48.610
<i>No!</i>

00:16:18.960 --> 00:16:21.450
<i>Nooo!</i>

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:32.070
<i>That tickles!</i>

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:40.660
<i>Are you... lonely?</i>

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:47.230
<i>It's okay.</i>

00:16:47.970 --> 00:16:50.340
<i>I'll be your mommy.</i>

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:11.250
Hakata

00:17:25.290 --> 00:17:26.760
<i>Tyranno...</i>

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:35.790
I'm your mom, after all, aren't I?

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:37.780
I have to do my best.

00:17:41.300 --> 00:17:42.310
Thank you.

00:17:43.220 --> 00:17:44.350
I found her!

00:17:53.290 --> 00:17:55.940
You can't just run off like that!

00:18:01.460 --> 00:18:03.930
But I'm glad you're safe.

00:18:09.160 --> 00:18:11.970
My mom is just missing.

00:18:11.970 --> 00:18:13.220
I know she's alive.

00:18:13.670 --> 00:18:19.400
I've continued my journey to find her 
with Tyranno now that he's grown, but...

00:18:20.880 --> 00:18:23.320
I met Mikado in Fukuoka.

00:18:29.090 --> 00:18:31.460
<i>Don't let that dinosaur Z/X inside the city!</i>

00:18:37.380 --> 00:18:39.410
<i>Don't be mean to Tyranno!</i>

00:18:39.420 --> 00:18:43.720
<i>We just want to go in there!</i>

00:18:44.420 --> 00:18:46.400
<i>None can stand against me!</i>

00:18:46.400 --> 00:18:48.590
<i>I am Alexander!</i>

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:11.250
<i>Don't be mean to Tyranno!</i>

00:19:18.840 --> 00:19:19.860
<i>That's enough.</i>

00:19:28.650 --> 00:19:29.390
<i>Kasuga...</i>

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:40.740
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:19:41.370 --> 00:19:42.530
<i>Are you hurt?</i>

00:19:48.770 --> 00:19:52.440
I thought to myself that if I 
went with him, I would be able...

00:19:53.360 --> 00:19:54.670
to find my mom.

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:56.340
I see.

00:19:57.070 --> 00:19:58.420
I hope you find her.

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:01.420
Yeah.

00:20:01.670 --> 00:20:03.180
Then let's all pray here.

00:20:04.840 --> 00:20:06.630
That you find her.

00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:11.150
And it's New Year's Day, anyway.

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:31.070
I pray that I'll find my mom.

00:20:37.650 --> 00:20:41.110
January 1st 17:39 Kobe Sea Hotel

00:20:40.010 --> 00:20:41.210
See you later!

00:20:41.470 --> 00:20:42.180
Yeah.

00:20:43.400 --> 00:20:45.010
I'm going home, too.

00:20:46.220 --> 00:20:50.470
Wait! Didn't Mikado tell 
us all to stay together?

00:20:50.800 --> 00:20:52.770
I refuse to do that.

00:20:54.500 --> 00:20:56.640
That girl...

00:20:56.640 --> 00:20:58.280
Shall we head home, too?

00:20:58.280 --> 00:20:59.580
Yes.

00:20:59.580 --> 00:21:00.480
Yeah.

00:21:06.330 --> 00:21:08.490
What is this about?!

00:21:09.730 --> 00:21:12.170
Mikado Kurosaki told us to.

00:21:12.170 --> 00:21:15.630
Alexander blew up our hotel.

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:43.030
Why?

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:47.490
Why did this happen to me?!

00:21:49.810 --> 00:21:52.540
Azumi Kagamihara is in Tennoji's room?

00:21:52.540 --> 00:21:54.390
Yes, so it seems.

00:21:55.190 --> 00:21:57.440
I told them to stay together,

00:21:57.440 --> 00:21:59.660
but I didn't tell them to<i> live </i>together.

00:22:06.510 --> 00:22:09.240
Just wait, Mom.

00:23:41.250 --> 00:23:44.230
Next time on <i>Z/X Ignition</i>:

00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:55.750
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:44.870 --> 00:23:46.230
Phase 9.

00:23:47.730 --> 00:23:52.160
The future awaiting 
Ayase Kamiyugi is stained black.
